---
layout: default
---
{%- comment -%}
  Home: due "diapositive" come su Canva.
    1) nome, presentazione (testo della pagina _pages/about.md) e foto
    2) Education & Certification (voci in _data/education.yml)
  Le posizioni sul desktop sono in _sass/_stefano.scss (sezione 7).
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="home">
  <section class="slide s-hero">
    <h1 class="home-name">{{ site.first_name }}<br class="br-d"> {{ site.last_name }}</h1>
    <div class="intro">
      {{ content }}
    </div>
    {% if page.photo %}
      <img
        class="photo"
        src="{{ page.photo | prepend: '/assets/img/' | relative_url }}"
        alt="{{ site.first_name }} {{ site.last_name }}"
        width="464"
        height="464"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
      >
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section class="slide s-edu" aria-label="Education and certification">
    <h2 class="edu-title">Education &amp;<br class="br-d"> Certification</h2>
    {%- comment -%} con 3 voci (come su Canva) ognuna va al suo posto esatto; con un numero diverso le voci si impilano {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="edu-list{% if site.data.education.size == 3 %} canva{% endif %}">
      {% for e in site.data.education %}
        <div class="entry">
          <h3>{{ e.title }}</h3>
          <p>
            {%- for l in e.lines -%}
              {{ l }}{% unless forloop.last %}<br>{% endunless %}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </p>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
